  "sourceTitle": "Cocoanut Caramels",
  "sourceText": "Cocoanut Caramels\nBy: Kitch-N-Chik\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 7:22pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 cups Brown sugar\n1 cup Milk\n1 teaspoon Butter\n1 cup Coconut\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Melt 1 c. brown sugar. Add milk, remaining brown sugar and butter. Boil to soft ball. Add coconut. Beat and drop from teaspoon on wax paper. Cool.",
